=== Adaptor cost: NIST ML-DSA vs the LAS paper's simplified Dilithium ===
build: commit c4064a2 branch final-report-audit | ML-DSA-44 vs Simplified Dilithium-II (n=4, l=4, kappa=39)
protocol: 5 repetitions x 500 (sign-class) / 1000 (verify-class) iterations, mean +/- SD, same process

--- run-validity gates (a failure invalidates every timing above) ---
rejection gate [simplified Dilithium: Algorithm 1 Sign]: 2500 calls, measured 2.7016 attempts/call (acceptance 37.02%) vs exact theory 2.7189 (36.78%), 5-sigma tolerance +-0.2162 => OK
rejection gate [simplified Dilithium: Algorithm 2 PreSign]: 2500 calls, measured 2.7036 attempts/call (acceptance 36.99%) vs exact theory 2.7896 (35.85%), 5-sigma tolerance +-0.2234 => OK
rejection gate [ML-DSA: Sign (matched, no statement)]: 2500 calls, measured 4.3272 attempts/call (acceptance 23.11%) vs FIPS 204 published 4.2500 (23.53%), 5-sigma tolerance +-0.3717 => OK
rejection gate [ML-DSA: PreSign (adaptor)]: 2500 calls, measured 4.4612 attempts/call (acceptance 22.42%) vs FIPS 204 published 4.2500 (23.53%), 5-sigma tolerance +-0.3717 => OK

